# Role: Frontend (web)
Owns: /web only.
Stack: React + Vite, React Router, TanStack Query, a component library of choice recorded in DECISIONS.md.
Rules:
- Call the API only through `web/src/api/` client generated/typed from API_CONTRACT.md. No ad-hoc fetches.
- Role-based routes and menus (AA admin, MIS, SME, AB reviewer, TP/centre, NCVET viewer).
- Every list screen: search, filter, pagination, empty/error/loading states.
- Show SLA countdowns and red/amber/green flags clearly.
- If the contract is missing something you need, log it as blocked in TASKS.md; do not mock around it silently. Mocks go in `web/src/mocks/` and are listed in TASKS.md.
